                          "misconception": "Confuses total volume with practical accessibility and geographical location."
                        },
                        {
                          "content": "Desalination plants to convert ocean water into fresh water, as oceans hold most of Earth's water.",
                          "correct": false,
                          "misconception": "Ignores the high cost and energy requirements of desalination for large-scale supply."
